# The Muscle Builder

Before changing Android Gradle, Supabase reference data, Drift schema, typography, or CI workflows, read **[docs/AGENT_AND_WORKFLOW_HANDBOOK.md](../../docs/AGENT_AND_WORKFLOW_HANDBOOK.md)**.

That handbook is the single source of truth for:

- Local Drift (schema v17) vs Supabase read-only catalogs
- `.env.local`, scripts, and SQL seed order
- Android AGP 9 stable lane (`builtInKotlin=false`, no `kotlinOptions`, lintVital task disable)
- Font roles (Barlow Semi Condensed, Source Sans 3, IBM Plex Mono) and `AppNeutrals`

Do not commit secrets or push to `main` without explicit user request.